<graphml xmlns="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns http://graphml.graphdrawing.org/xmlns/1.0/graphml.xsd">
  <key id="d6" for="edge" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d5" for="edge" attr.name="keywords" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d4" for="edge" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d3" for="edge" attr.name="weight" attr.type="double" />
  <key id="d2" for="node" attr.name="source_id" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d1" for="node" attr.name="description" attr.type="string" />
  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;ZEKI HAKAN SIDALI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Zeki Hakan Sidali is a person who has found a new home and a new sense of purpose in rural France."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zeki Hakan Sidali is a seasoned Turkish politician who has served as a Member of the Grand National Assembly of Turkey and has made Naintré his home, promoting cultural exchange and understanding between the French and Turkish communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ANKARA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ankara is the capital city of Turkey where Zeki Hakan Sidali has been making waves in the country's political landscape."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRAND NATIONAL ASSEMBLY OF TURKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Grand National Assembly of Turkey is the legislative body of Turkey where Zeki Hakan Sidali serves as a Member."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;27TH PARLIAMENT OF TURKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The 27th Parliament of Turkey is the specific parliament where Zeki Hakan Sidali was elected in 2018."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TURKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Turkey is the country where Zeki Hakan Sidali was born and raised, and where he serves as a Member of the Grand National Assembly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NAINTRÉ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Naintré is a small town in the Vienne region of France where Zeki Hakan Sidali has lived for over a decade and is respected for his efforts in promoting cultural exchange."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VIENNE REGION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Vienne region is the area in France where Naintré is located, known for its rolling hills and charming towns."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MAIRIE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mairie is the town hall in Naintré where the annual town hall meeting takes place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CONSEILLERS MUNICIPAUX&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Conseillers municipaux are the local municipal council members in Naintré where Zeki Hakan Sidali sits during meetings."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH AND TURKISH COMMUNITIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The French and Turkish communities refer to the two groups that Zeki Hakan Sidali promotes cultural exchange and understanding between."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CULTURAL EXCHANGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cultural exchange is the effort Zeki Hakan Sidali makes to promote understanding and cooperation between the French and Turkish communities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EDUCATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Education is one of the policy areas Zeki Hakan Sidali advocates for, contributing to the betterment of Turkish society."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEALTHCARE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Healthcare is another policy area Zeki Hakan Sidali advocates for, contributing to the betterment of Turkish society."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ECONOMIC DEVELOPMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Economic development is yet another policy area Zeki Hakan Sidali advocates for, contributing to the betterment of Turkish society."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TURKISH MEDIA OUTLETS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Turkish media outlets are the sources that widely reported the election results of Zeki Hakan Sidali to the 27th Parliament of Turkey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TURKISH PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Turkish people are the constituents Zeki Hakan Sidali represents and works to benefit through his advocacy and interventions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEMOCRATIC VALUES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Democratic values are the principles that Zeki Hakan Sidali upholds and promotes through his political actions and advocacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOWN HALL MEETING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Town hall meeting is the annual gathering in Naintré where the townspeople discuss community developments and concerns."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROLLING HILLS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rolling hills are a geographical feature of the Vienne region, known for their charm and beauty."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CROISSANTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Croissants are a culinary tradition in the Vienne region, known for their sweet aroma and taste."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PATISSERIE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Patisserie is a local bakery in Naintré known for baking fresh croissants."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CAFÉ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Café is a local establishment in Naintré where people gather to socialize and enjoy coffee and pastries."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SUN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sun is a natural element that sets the scene for the evening in Naintré, symbolizing the start of the town hall meeting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WHISPERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Whispers are the sounds of appreciation and respect that follow Zeki Hakan Sidali after the town hall meeting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TALL, IMPOSING FIGURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DESCRIPTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tall, imposing figure describes Zeki Hakan Sidali's physical appearance, emphasizing his presence and authority."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RURAL FRANCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rural France is the setting where Zeki Hakan Sidali has found a new home and a new sense of purpose."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0087</data>
    </node>
